{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkxcQFsMAoNt9R11Hgyb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'd go with Harel's \"עוקב מדד S&P 500\", but I'm not sure which version, and I haven't actually done anything yet. That name keeps coming back with about \"13.7%\" for 3 years and \"11.9%\" for 5. That's what decided it for me. The problem is it shows up in like five places on the page, and I can't tell which one is for 30,000 ₪ of my own money.\n\n**Where I looked, in order**\n- **Top of the page.** The heading \"הראל\", the \"כל המוצרים 105\" button and the row of product buttons. 105 products, seriously.\n- **First table, \"קופת גמל להשקעה\".** \"קופת גמל\" sounds like a pension thing for old people, so I nearly scrolled past it. Then I saw \"עוקב מדד S&P 500\" with \"0.54%\"–\"0.56% מהחיסכון\", 13.7% over 3 years and 11.92% over 5. That's where it clicked. \"מניות\" has 24.04% for 3 years, which is more, but there's no S&P in the name.\n- **\"קרן השתלמות\".** I already have one of these from work. The S&P tracker there is \"0.5% מהחיסכון\" with almost the same returns, 13.71% and 11.89%. Is that the same thing for less? No idea.\n- **\"תגמולים ואישית לפיצויים\", \"חיסכון לכל ילד\", \"קרן חדשה מקיפה\", \"קרן חדשה כללית\".** I scrolled fast. It's the same S&P row again and again with the same numbers. The new-fund ones say \"0.15% מהחיסכון\" but also \"1.47%\" or \"1.14% מההפקדה\". That's pension, not my 30k, so I moved on.\n- **\"מרכזית לפיצויים\".** Skipped it.\n- **\"קרנות מחקות\".** Finally something I know. \"הראל מחקה S&P 500\" shows \"קבועים 0%\" and \"משתנים 0.1%\", which looks way cheaper. But there's no return shown at all, so I can't compare it to the 13.7%. Next to it are tags like \"חשיפה לדולר\" and \"מס גם על שינויי המטבע\". That second one is in red, and it scared me a bit.\n- **\"קרנות סל\".** Same deal, \"קבועים 0.6%\" for S&P. Is that the same thing as קרן מחקה? I still don't know.\n- **The bottom.** The folds under \"מה כתוב במסמכים של הראל\" and the footer. Didn't open any of them.\n\n**Words I didn't get**\n- \"מההפקדה\" next to \"מהחיסכון\". Two different fees?\n- \"נאמן\" (0.02%)\n- \"מנוטרלת מט\"ח\"\n- \"צוברת\"\n- \"כמה דרכים יחד\"\n- \"קבועים / משתנים\"\n- \"4A / 4D\"\n- \"פחות מ־3 שנים\" where the return should be. I think it means the track is too new.\n- The \"PF-06\" and \"PF-10\" notes at the bottom. Didn't read them.\n\n**What bothered me**\n- It's way too long. Around 96 rows that all look the same, and on a phone I'd have quit in the middle of the קרן חדשה part.\n- Every fee is a percent. It never says what that comes to in shekels on my money.\n- The cheapest S&P option, the קרן מחקה, has no returns next to it, so I can't line it up against the others.\n- Nothing tells me which of these I can actually just put 30k into, or what to do first."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4090,"cache_read_input_tokens":22018,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4090},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c1613ad5-1250-43bb-a1bb-fbf69edea1ea","uuid":"1f87e551-3ea7-4cf7-934f-27ae6f3c4172","timestamp":"2026-11-06T03:24:59.212Z","request_id":"req_011CgkxcQ3Ug2BHzteZ7ZdeM"}
